  "slug": "easy-basil-pesto-with-almonds",
  "name": "Easy Basil Pesto with Almonds",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "Making basil pesto with almonds instead of pine nuts is just as tasty and probably less expensive to make since pine nuts are more expensive!",
  "cuisine": "Italian",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine basil, Parmesan cheese, almonds, olive oil, and garlic in a food processor; pulse until blended. Pour in more olive oil, with the processor running, until pesto is thick and smooth."
    }
  ],
